  "qid": "302",
  "tip": "<p>When you see a requirement for outbound internet from private or hybrid hosts with <i>no public IPs on the hosts</i>, think <i>Cloud NAT</i> on a VPC that exchanges routes with the environment using <i>Cloud Router</i>. Confirm that the design provides egress only and that firewall rules can restrict destinations.</p>",
